  reel_script says Raghavan was arrested for theft in Annur area; the article says he was arrested for theft-related offences in Annur, which is roughly consistent, but the reel_script mentions 'திருட்டு வழக்கில்' — acceptable; however the reel_script omits that he was recaptured/caught after escaping from police custody on the arrest day, an important fact missing
